        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>CP263 Lab 02_05 Comparator (Sum of Products)

Z1 = ~C.~D.(A ^ B) + A.~C.(B ^ D) + A.B.(C ^ D)
Z2 = ~A.~B.(C ^ D) + C.(~B.D + ~A.B)
Z3 = (B *^ D).(C *^ A)

Note that * means XNOR Gate</string>
